#In this dataset, the aerodynamics coefficients are calculated from the measured aero forces and moments. These are then compared to the original input data.
#
#The intent is to show how the aero forces and moments are calculated from the coefficient data, and to confirm that the input data is reflected faithfully in the simulated behavior.
